Central Tokyo / easy transit
- Park Hotel Tokyo (Shiodome/near Ginza)
  - Design-forward, widely praised for family-friendly service; good options for connecting rooms or family suites; great location for city sightseeing and transit.
- Andaz Tokyo Toranomon Hills (Minato)
  - Luxury option with spacious rooms and suites; excellent service; easy access to multiple subway lines; great for families who want a bit of extra space.
